  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Wuz Nothin'**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **It's Gonna Be (Alright)**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Dirty Money**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-04-25.InsideOut_ck63** (recommended): source not stated; 37 songs; 179 min [1]\n- **ween2023-04-25.InsideOut_AKG.ck61.ck63**: source not stated; 37 songs; 179 min [2]\n- **ween2023-03-25**: source not stated; 37 songs; 178 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-04-25.InsideOut_ck63**: taped by HealthCov Chris; transferred by InsideOut Recording; source: AKG ck63 (PAS) > Nbob actives > Naiant pfa > SD MixPre-6 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG ck63 microphones (PAS), through Nbob actives and a Naiant preamp, onto an SD MixPre-6 recorder [1]\n- **ween2023-04-25.InsideOut_AKG.ck61.ck63**: taped by HealthCov Chris; transferred by InsideOut Recording; source: AKG ck61 + ck63 > Nbob actives > Naiant pfa > SD MixPre-6 [2]. Also: Two sources: AKG ck61 (NOS) and ck63 (PAS), each via Nbob actives and Naiant preamp to SD MixPre-6; Chris at InsideOut Recording handled the pull and processing, using HealthCov [2]\n- **ween2023-03-25**: taped by Rich Cuiffo; transferred by Rich Cuiffo; source: Schoeps MK41s and Schoeps MK22's> Nbob actives > Sound Devices MixPre 6 II [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by South Side Ballroom: [South Side BallroomSouth Side Ballroom | Ween](https://southsideballroomdallas.com/event/ween-2/) [5]",
